    "jp_content_update_v1": "{\"app\":\"command-center-content\",\"version\":1,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-28\",\"sections\":{\"finance\":{\"label\":\"Aug 28 snapshot\",\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n  <div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-sm mb-1.5\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Immediate Cash Goal</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">$5.2k / $10k</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"progress-bar\\\"><div class=\\\"progress-fill bg-indigo-500\\\" style=\\\"width:52%\\\"></div></div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-sm mb-1.5\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Emergency Savings → $60k</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-slate-500\\\">~$22.7k / $60k</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"progress-bar\\\"><div class=\\\"progress-fill bg-emerald-500\\\" style=\\\"width:38%\\\"></div></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-4\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"kpi\\\"><p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase\\\">Schwab</p><p class=\\\"text-lg font-bold\\\">$13,734</p></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"kpi\\\"><p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase\\\">E*TRADE</p><p class=\\\"text-lg font-bold\\\">$1,912</p></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"kpi\\\"><p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase\\\">Public</p><p class=\\\"text-lg font-bold\\\">$1,855</p></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"kpi\\\"><p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase\\\">Cash</p><p class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-emerald-500\\\">$5,158</p></div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"card p-4 mt-4\\\">\\n  <h3 class=\\\"font-semibold mb-1\\\">Main Positions <span class=\\\"text-xs font-normal text-slate-500\\\">(~$17.5k investments)</span></h3>\\n  <p class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mb-3\\\">Schwab net liq $13.73k · Open P/L −$1,134 · Day −$51</p>\\n  <div class=\\\"space-y-2 text-sm\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700/40\\\"><span><b>TSLA</b> 17</span><span class=\\\"font-mono\\\">$6,058 <span class=\\\"text-red-500 text-xs\\\">−11.2%</span></span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700/40\\\"><span><b>SPCX</b> Pub 13 + E*T 10</span><span class=\\\"font-mono\\\">~$3.23k <span class=\\\"text-emerald-500 text-xs\\\">+3–4%</span></span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700/40\\\"><span><b>MSTR</b> 17</span><span class=\\\"font-mono\\\">$2,292 <span class=\\\"text-emerald-500 text-xs\\\">+8.7%</span></span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700/40\\\"><span><b>PLTR</b> 8</span><span class=\\\"font-mono\\\">$1,478 <span class=\\\"text-emerald-500 text-xs\\\">+48%</span></span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700/40\\\"><span><b>STRC</b> 15</span><span class=\\\"font-mono\\\">$1,470 <span class=\\\"text-emerald-500 text-xs\\\">+2.8%</span></span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex justify-between py-1.5\\\"><span><b>CBRS</b> 6</span><span class=\\\"font-mono\\\">$1,110 <span class=\\\"text-red-500 text-xs\\\">−18%</span></span></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"card p-4 mt-4 border-l-4 border-l-emerald-500\\\">\\n  <h3 class=\\\"font-semibold mb-2\\\">Insights &amp; Next Steps</h3>\\n  <ul class=\\\"text-sm space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n    <li>• <b>Cash buffer reset to $5,158 (52%).</b> Checking $1,693 + Savings $3,465. Checking is Discover cash-back $921 + Schwab Investor Checking $772 — no standalone operating checking showed. Month spend $3,987. Payday in 7 days (~$3,593 payroll incoming).</li>\\n    <li>• <b>Emergency / net worth $22,650</b> (38% of $60k). Rocket Money matches. Drop from ~$26.5k is almost all cash, not investments (~$17.5k still).</li>\\n    <li>• <b>Schwab still concentrated and on margin.</b> Open P/L −$1,134. Long stock ~$15.1k vs net liq $13.7k (margin −$1.3k). TSLA is still the biggest name and still red; PLTR remains the standout (+48%).</li>\\n    <li>• <b>Rule:</b> Cash = Rocket Money Checking + Savings groups only. Do not count brokerage equity toward the $10k buffer.</li>\\n    <li>• <b>Next:</b> Let payroll refill the buffer first. Lock $10k before adding risk. SPCX is now a real sleeve across Public + E*TRADE (~$3.2k).</li>\\n  </ul>\\n</div>\"},\"news\":{\"label\":\"Aug 28 · curated\",\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"news-categories\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"space-y-3 news-cat\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300\\\">Markets</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"relative h-28 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <img alt=\\\"Markets\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611974789855-9c2a0a7236a3?w=800&amp;q=80\\\"/>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-2 left-3 text-white text-xs font-medium\\\">Nvidia · Fed · oil</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Nvidia lifts Nasdaq; indexes finish week higher</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Thu close: Dow 53,569 · S&amp;P 7,731 · Nasdaq 26,541. Week so far: S&amp;P +0.7%, Nasdaq +1.4%.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">AI megacaps did the lifting</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Nvidia +8.7% after a strong forecast. Salesforce jumped ~20%+. Equal-weight S&amp;P was roughly flat.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Street turns to Warsh at Jackson Hole</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">New Fed Chair Kevin Warsh speaks Friday. Yields ticked up into the speech after a solid jobs read.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"news-cat-spacer\\\" style=\\\"height:2.5rem;flex-shrink:0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"space-y-3 news-cat\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-indigo-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/40 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300\\\">Elon · SpaceX · Tesla</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"relative h-28 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <img alt=\\\"SpaceX\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1446776653964-20c1d3a81b06?w=800&amp;q=80\\\"/>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-2 left-3 text-white text-xs font-medium\\\">Starship · Starlink · SPCX</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Starship Flight 14 slips toward mid-September</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Booster 21 is on Pad 2 for static fire. First full orbital attempt with ~20 Starlink V3s; ship catch deferred.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Musk: Falcon 9 winds down once Starship is weekly</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">He said scarce engineering should shift to several Starship flights per day after reliable weekly cadence.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Starlink-in-every-car push continues</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Cybercab shown with a flush Starlink V5 roof antenna; Musk repeated that all Tesla vehicles get Starlink.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"news-cat-spacer\\\" style=\\\"height:2.5rem;flex-shrink:0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"space-y-3 news-cat\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-900/40 text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300\\\">Tech &amp; AI</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"relative h-28 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <img alt=\\\"AI\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677442136019-21780ecad995?w=800&amp;q=80\\\"/>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-2 left-3 text-white text-xs font-medium\\\">Chips · labs · cyber</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Nvidia forecast revived the AI trade</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Outlook implied roughly 70% revenue growth into FY2028. Rubin shipments still slated for autumn.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">OpenAI, Anthropic warn of an AI-attack window</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">100+ firms signed an open letter Thursday: AI-enabled cyberattacks could surge within months.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Anthropic locks more compute</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Reports this week included a large Nscale rental and continued data-center buildout as Claude demand stays hot.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"news-cat-spacer\\\" style=\\\"height:2.5rem;flex-shrink:0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"space-y-3 news-cat\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-sky-100 dark:bg-sky-900/40 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300\\\">Science</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"relative h-28 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <img alt=\\\"Science\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1446776811953-b23d57bd21aa?w=800&amp;q=80\\\"/>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-2 left-3 text-white text-xs font-medium\\\">JWST · early galaxies</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Hidden small stars make early galaxies heavier</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">JWST spectra of nine massive galaxies suggest 3–4× more stellar mass than earlier estimates (Nature Astronomy).</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Little Red Dots may be compact galaxies + black holes</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">New analysis of 217 LRDs treats them as tiny systems with oversized central black holes, not isolated points of light.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">JWST maps how comets get their crystals</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Outburst at protostar EC 53 forged crystalline silicates, then outflows carried them outward toward the cold disk.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"news-cat-spacer\\\" style=\\\"height:2.5rem;flex-shrink:0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"space-y-3 news-cat\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/40 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300\\\">Trump Admin</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"relative h-28 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <img alt=\\\"Policy\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529107386315-e1a2ed48a620?w=800&amp;q=80\\\"/>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-2 left-3 text-white text-xs font-medium\\\">Iran · Hormuz · Fed</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Trump: no new talks with Iran</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">He said Iran is “in deep trouble,” the strait is moving ships, and Washington is not looking to restart negotiations.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Iran war hits the six-month mark</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Friday marks six months. Trump told Al Jazeera he has “no time schedule” to wrap the conflict.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Warsh’s first Jackson Hole speech is Friday</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Markets want a clearer inflation/rates line from the new Fed chair, who has spoken less than predecessors.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"news-cat-spacer\\\" style=\\\"height:2.5rem;flex-shrink:0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"space-y-3 news-cat\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300\\\">UAP / UFOs</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"relative h-28 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <img alt=\\\"UAP\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1419242902214-272b3f66ee7a?w=800&amp;q=80\\\"/>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-2 left-3 text-white text-xs font-medium\\\">PURSUE · AARO · orbs</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Fifth PURSUE tranche still circulating</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Aug 7 dump added more recent videos. Pentagon still says no verified extraterrestrial tech; hundreds of cases stay open.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">AC-130 “orbs” remain the clip people share</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Gunship footage of objects near a live-fire target, described as moving in formation at high speed, is still the main talking point.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Avi Loeb: most slow orbs are probably drones</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">This week he argued low-speed, radar-quiet formations are likely human-made; outliers still need better sensors.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"news-cat-spacer\\\" style=\\\"height:2.5rem;flex-shrink:0\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"space-y-3 news-cat\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/40 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300\\\">Trending</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"relative h-28 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <img alt=\\\"Trending\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504711434969-e33886168f5c?w=800&amp;q=80\\\"/>\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-2 left-3 text-white text-xs font-medium\\\">Chips · Hormuz · midterms</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Oil eased on Hormuz traffic</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Crude pulled back from a two-week rally as the U.S. said ships are moving and no new Iran talks are planned.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Nvidia’s day was most of the S&amp;P’s gain</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Its market-cap jump accounted for nearly all of Thursday’s S&amp;P advance — a reminder how narrow the tape is.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"news-card\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"font-medium text-sm\\\">Six-month Iran war is now a midterm issue</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\\\">Coverage this week framed the conflict as longer than promised and competing with the tax-cut message heading into fall.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\"},\"entertainment\":{\"label\":\"Matched to your taste\",\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"space-y-6\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-900/40 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300\\\">Coming Soon</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"card px-3 py-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n                <img alt=\\\"Dune\\\" class=\\\"w-16 h-24 rounded-lg object-cover shrink-0 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469854523086-cc02fe5d8800?w=300&amp;q=80\\\"/>\\n                <div class=\\\"min-w-0 flex-1\\\">\\n                  <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start gap-2\\\">\\n                    <p class=\\\"font-semibold text-sm\\\">Dune: Part Three</